      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont think its the firmware. it literally only happens when i'm talking. like the rhythm of the pulse matches the cadence of my voice. it's almost like the light is reacting to me, but in a way that feels... i dont know, like it's transmitting something. is there any way these bulbs could be used to pick up audio through frequency variations?",
